<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details crop development.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details crop development.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of crop development to Sunday.</p>
<p>CEREALS  TILLERED JOINTED SHOTBLADE HEADING SOFT DOUGH</p>
<p>July 20    0 pct    2 pct  16 pct    73 pct   0 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  0 pct    6 pct  32 pct    58 pct   4 pct</p>
<p>CANOLA   SEEDLING ROSETTE FLOWERING PODDING</p>
<p>July 20    0 pct    5 pct  67 pct    28 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  1 pct   14 pct  74 pct    10 pct</p>
<p>FLAX     SEEDLING TILLERED FLOWERING BOLL</p>
<p>July 20    1 pct   18 pct  70 pct    11 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  2 pct   45 pct  51 pct     2 pct</p>
<p>FALL CRP SHOTBLADE HEADED  DOUGH     RIPE</p>
<p>July 20    0 pct   11 pct  63 pct    26 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  1 pct   14 pct  75 pct    11 pct</p>
<p>PULSE CRP VEGETATE FLOWER  PODDING</p>
<p>July 20    5 pct   62 pct  33 pct</p>
<p>July 22/96 17 pct  72 pct  11 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
